{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>BOXBOYMAN</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job: receive, drive, deliver, repeat. The packages? Fragile. The clock? Yes. The dogs? A BOXBOYMANs arch nemesis, maybe. Not really, the dogs are not that mean. They are kind of nice actually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play through is procedurally generated for your convenience and discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver everything without error and mostly intact, beat the timer, keep the van limping along, and you'll move on... to even more boxes.\u00a0It\u2019s a lifestyle. <i>It\u2019s a game.</i> It's you. It's me.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s BOXBOYMAN. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3495230?t=1761844509","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3495230?t=1761844509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495230/4ab831b4ff45eb030de264356b5ed07bc78852a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761844509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495230/4ab831b4ff45eb030de264356b5ed07bc78852a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761844509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>BOXBOYMAN</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job: receive, drive, deliver, repeat. The packages? Fragile. The clock? Yes. The dogs? A BOXBOYMANs arch nemesis, maybe. Not really, the dogs are not that mean. They are kind of nice actually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play through is procedurally generated for your convenience and discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver everything without error and mostly intact, beat the timer, keep the van limping along, and you'll move on... to even more boxes.\u00a0It\u2019s a lifestyle. <i>It\u2019s a game.</i> It's you. It's me.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s BOXBOYMAN. </p>","developers":["waxycaps"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495230/814385ce1a6b3e744cd9756ffa0c5ef5e29a8186/header.jpg?t=1761844509","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3495230/574228937/ebbcdfab2b438d8bb47f82c97311ff13e65411ab/1750564113/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750567386","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3495230/574228937/ebbcdfab2b438d8bb47f82c97311ff13e65411ab/1750564113/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750567386","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3495230/574228937/ebbcdfab2b438d8bb47f82c97311ff13e65411ab/1750564113/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750567386","id":257159814,"name":"BOXBOYMAN Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159814/8d58390ec9f3c46b7f2065c46cdb39c40f61b2bc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750567386"}],"name":"BOXBOYMAN","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> This is needed too<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A good idea<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 650 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This is mo